# Build output
/dist/
*.exe
*.test
*.out
*.prof

# Local dev
.env
*.local

# Never commit decrypted secrets or a live secrets dir
*.sops.decrypted
/run/
/secrets/

# Internal governance and context docs live on disk here but are versioned
# centrally in the projects-docs repo, never in this public repo.
/CLAUDE.md
/CHARTER.md
# docs/ stays public because users need it: README, the LABELS/INGEST reference,
# docs/TESTING.md (the Testing Standard mandates and CI-gates it), design docs.
# Only CLAUDE.md and CHARTER.md are versioned centrally in projects-docs. core
# has no internal decisions log, so nothing under docs/ is carved out here.
